                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Such a good game. It's tactical and engaging. It's fun to balance the party and to take turns with them. Good individual powers, great to experiment with weapons. There aren't enough slots to carry everything, so some hard choices there. You can collect hats, but that's not really my thing. You can play one mission or just stack a few in a row. Highly recommended.",
